> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT * FROM r WHERE a = 10 AND b < '2023-01-01'
QUERY PLAN:text
Seq Scan on r1 r
  Filter: ((b < '2023-01-01'::date) AND (a = 10))
